      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If we still want to keep this system even though it might be somewhat obsolete (unless we say it could still work as a rank for un-mute so streamers and such can avoid spam and bad words from trolls etc.) we could still introduce a system that ranks people based on the quality of their avatars which could be more useful when looking to save on performance\n\nFor example, let's say that there are people who make their avatars horribly optimized, they could still be \"trusted\" as a player but \"low level\" (yeah, no imagination here) in terms of their custom avatars and as such their avatars could be blocked.\n\nplayers can then use this new filters to make their game only load avatars from people who are know to make optimized avatars.\n\nor just make a system based on the performance stats once they are good enough I guess.\n\n(I know that last thing people, and more over creators want is more filters to jump through for their avatars)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
