      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c17fca39142d1751b2f26c6|full_name}: This would make sense, and help massively for people using lower-end systems; Again, people will complain that it'll 'seperate the community', but it's totally avoidable in terms of avatar performance. :)\nGood performance doesn't mean the avatar has to look bad, and 150+ dynamic bones doesn't always make an avatar look good. :p",
